<title>AUSTRALIA: Normandy rejects Mt Leyshon bid - St Barbara.</title>
<headline>Normandy rejects Mt Leyshon bid - St Barbara.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold miner St Barbara Mines Ltd said on Wednesday that Normandy Mining Ltd, the largest shareholder in Mt Leyshon Gold Mines Ltd, would not accept its current offer for Mt Leyshon.</p>
</text>
